{"ok": true, "messages": [{"ts": "1758846818.863989", "type": "message", "text": "A verlo iba pero ya lo habian mergeado", "channel": "D05S1S2H55M", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0021_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758846841.366909", "type": "message", "text": "fijate que no he querido pullear de main hasta que todos los bugs esten verificados, sino estaria haciendo un merge cada dia", "channel": "D05S1S2H55M", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0021_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758846868.774319", "type": "message", "text": "voy a esperar a que digan que ya se puede pushear el feature para pullear de main, mergear y mandar el pull request", "channel": "D05S1S2H55M", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0021_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758847394.614139", "type": "message", "text": "[USERNAME_20062] no hay problema, al final Blake le dio una revisada", "channel": "D05S1S2H55M", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0006_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758848169.753889", "type": "message", "text": "The code looks like it plays both at the same time. Ok. If [USERNAME_37176] says it's good then it's good.", "channel": "D051LNQSFGQ", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758883277.402889", "type": "message", "text": "Brian asked me to do a full pass on the home screen flow after a level. I started a sheet for it today, everything goes in there", "channel": "D06UPGF5PQV", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0012_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758897342.468489", "type": "message", "text": "have you got to start working on the endless screen from main menu ? i 've modified the loading bar prefab a bit", "channel": "D05U73FNDDL", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758897610.911369", "type": "message", "text": "look it doesnt matter how it gona look, you just make it function after u work it out i can get back in the prefab and adjust the visuals", "channel": "D05U73FNDDL", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758898059.375379", "type": "message", "text": "Hey Marcus, no I haven't started yet on that.. I was still addressing some bugs yesterday :[USERNAME_8114]:", "channel": "D05U73FNDDL", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0006_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758898077.934099", "type": "message", "text": "you can make the modify and will implement it later", "channel": "D05U73FNDDL", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0006_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758898426.839189", "type": "message", "text": "great Thanx!", "channel": "D05U73FNDDL", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758898457.734689", "type": "message", "text": "its better this way cuz i can open the stuff and adjust it for you now so u wont encounter any trouble later", "channel": "D05U73FNDDL", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758900339.983269", "type": "message", "text": "Yeah, no problem :[USERNAME_41056]", "channel": "D05U73FNDDL", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0006_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758905651.826879", "type": "message", "text": "you can start working on your part with the ticket. i still have work to do on the gameplay part", "channel": "D05U73FNDDL", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758905679.456409", "type": "message", "text": "because i had to give to [PERSON_NAME_0092] the zombie characters so the guys who build the playable ads have them so they can start working on it", "channel": "D05U73FNDDL", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758906204.379689", "type": "message", "text": "Oh okay so after I finish you will tweak a bit the VFX", "channel": "D05U73FNDDL", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0006_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758906254.306499", "type": "message", "text": "yah visual stuff , but then i'm gona make a ticket for the gameplay one cuz thats also what i'm working on", "channel": "D05U73FNDDL", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758906304.183649", "type": "message", "text": "Okay sure :[USERNAME_26053]:", "channel": "D05U73FNDDL", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0006_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758917912.595939", "type": "message", "text": "ya mande el PR, cuando lo acepten ya vas a poder trabajar directamente en main", "channel": "D05S1S2H55M", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0021_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758917928.119279", "type": "message", "text": "y vas a poder mandar un nuevo PR desde otra branch ya con la integracion de win and collect al queue manager", "channel": "D05S1S2H55M", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0021_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758917931.332889", "type": "message", "text": "sorry ahi por el delay", "channel": "D05S1S2H55M", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0021_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758920577.632899", "type": "message", "text": "[PERSON_NAME_75079] gracias, [PERSON_NAME_67546] [USERNAME_10427]:open_mouth:", "channel": "D05S1S2H55M", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0006_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1759156446.484629", "type": "message", "text": "ok so i pushed a modifications on the prefab on my branch, Marcus/EndlessMode_Vfx", "channel": "D05U73FNDDL", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1759156465.719769", "type": "message", "text": "<https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-565/endless-horde-start-screen-vfx> <---- i wrote a comment on the linear task", "channel": "D05U73FNDDL", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1759156510.271039", "type": "message", "text": "im going to continue working on this branch for the stuff in the core game. on the endless screen as well the boss arena one", "channel": "D05U73FNDDL", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1759161227.073829", "type": "message", "text": "Should I make another branch for those changes? and merge it", "channel": "D05U73FNDDL", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0006_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1759161263.189149", "type": "message", "text": "[USERNAME_19058]", "channel": "D05U73FNDDL", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1759161273.930409", "type": "message", "text": "but i'm still working with the green bar and stuff but on other prefabs", "channel": "D05U73FNDDL", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1759161281.748859", "type": "message", "text": "i belive it wont do any conflict", "channel": "D05U73FNDDL", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1759161289.715329", "type": "message", "text": "cuz i'm done with the bar itself", "channel": "D05U73FNDDL", "user": "EM